Package: humangentools
Title: Tools for Conducting 'tidypopgen' Analyses Using Common Human SNP Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jason", "Hodgson", , "jason.hodgson@aru.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A suite of tools to facilitate 'tidypopgen' analyses with common
    human genomics data sets including HGDP and 1000 Genomes, and to work
    alongside 'dplaceR' for cross-cultural context. Provides sample and
    population metadata lookup, and SNP panel selection for the Axiom Human
    Origins array.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://jasonahodgson.github.io/humangentools/, https://github.com/JasonAHodgson/humangentools
BugReports: https://github.com/JasonAHodgson/humangentools/issues
